                                    "snippet": {
                                        "text": "    /** Reads the details from a saved document and lets the user check them before saving. */\n    private void readDetails(UserDocument d, DocumentReader.Kind kind) {\n        Ui.toast(this, \"Reading your \" + kind.label.toLowerCase() + \"…\");\n        Background.run(this, () -> DocumentReader.read(this, d, kind),\n                result -> DocumentReview.show(this, user, result),\n"
